  "description": "\u201cOn a given straight line to describe a square.\u201d\n\u2014 Euclid's Elements, BOOK I \u2022 PROP. 46 (G.75)\n\n00:00 1 \u00b7 GIVEN: / A B /\n00:11 2 \u00b7 CONSTRUCT: perpendicular_at(/ A B /, A) \u2192 / A C / \u22a5 / A B /, cut_equal_segment(/ A C /, / A B /) \u2192 / A D / = / A B /\n00:21 3 \u00b7 CONSTRUCT: parallel_line(D, / A B /) \u2192 / D E / \u2225 / A B /, parallel_line(B, / A D /) \u2192 / B E / \u2225 / A D / \u2192 \u27e8 A D E B \u27e9\n00:31 4 \u00b7 ASSERT: / A B / = / D E /, / A D / = / B E /, / A B / = / A D / \u2192 / B A / = / A D / = / D E / = / E B /\n00:47 5 \u00b7 ASSERT: \u27e8 B A D ) + \u27e8 A D E ) = 2\u221f, \u27e8 B A D ) = \u221f \u2192 \u27e8 B A D ) = \u27e8 A D E ) = \u27e8 A B E ) = \u27e8 B E D ) = \u221f\n01:03 6 \u00b7 \u2234: / B A / = / A D / = / D E / = / E B /, \u27e8 B A D ) = \u27e8 A D E ) = \u27e8 A B E ) = \u27e8 B E D ) = \u221f \u2192 \u27e8 A D E B \u27e9\n\nGEOMETOR \u2022 G.75 \u2022 v2",
